#: ../../../../README.md:2466
msgid "Why PyGMT?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../README.md:2468
msgid ""
"A beautiful map is worth a thousand words. To truly understand how powerful "
"PyGMT is, play with it online on [Binder](https://github.com/"
"GenericMappingTools/try-gmt)! For a quicker introduction, check out our [3 "
"minute overview](https://youtu.be/4iPnITXrxVU)!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../README.md:2472
msgid ""
"Afterwards, feel free to look at our [Tutorials](https://www.pygmt.org/"
"latest/tutorials), visit the [Gallery](https://www.pygmt.org/latest/"
"gallery), and check out some [external PyGMT examples](https://www.pygmt.org/"
"latest/external_resources.html)!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../README.md:2476
msgid ""
